---
// AdvantagesSection.astro
---

<section id="ventajas" class="section advantages-section">
	<div class="section-container">
		<div class="adv-grid">
			<div class="adv-content">
				<span class="section-badge font-cinzel">DISTINCIÓN TOTAL</span>
				<h2 class="section-title font-cinzel">¿Por Qué Elegir <br /><span class="gold-gradient-text">GANA PRO?</span></h2>
				<p class="adv-desc">
					No somos un banco común ni una aplicación ordinaria. Somos una infraestructura tecnológica de élite concebida para quienes buscan el pináculo de la elegancia, rapidez de ejecución y confidencialidad absoluta.
				</p>

				<div class="features-list">
					<div class="feature-item">
						<div class="check-box">
							<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
						</div>
						<div>
							<h4 class="font-cinzel">Modo Día y Noche Impecable</h4>
							<p>Adapta tu experiencia visual con un solo clic entre la serenidad del día y el lujo nocturno imperial.</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="feature-item">
						<div class="check-box">
							<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
						</div>
						<div>
							<h4 class="font-cinzel">Auditoría Criptográfica Continua</h4>
							<p>Cuentas protegidas mediante algoritmos criptográficos avanzados PBKDF2 sin fugas de datos.</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="feature-item">
						<div class="check-box">
							<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
						</div>
						<div>
							<h4 class="font-cinzel">Atención Personalizada Concierge</h4>
							<p>Ejecutivos de cuenta asignados listos para asistirle en todo momento en cualquier zona horaria.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="adv-preview luxury-card">
				<div class="vault-card">
					<div class="vault-header">
						<span class="vault-tag">ESTADO DEL PORTAFOLIO</span>
						<span class="vault-live">● EN VIVO</span>
					</div>
					<div class="vault-amount gold-gradient-text font-cinzel">$1,450,280.00</div>
					<div class="vault-growth">+24.6% vs mes anterior</div>
					<div class="vault-bars">
						<div class="bar bar-1"></div>
						<div class="bar bar-2"></div>
						<div class="bar bar-3"></div>
						<div class="bar bar-4"></div>
						<div class="bar bar-5"></div>
						<div class="bar bar-6"></div>
						<div class="bar bar-7"></div>
					</div>
					<div class="vault-footer">
						<div class="v-item">
							<small>Nivel de Miembro</small>
							<strong>Black Diamond</strong>
						</div>
						<div class="v-item text-right">
							<small>Cripto / Metales</small>
							<strong>Protegido 100%</strong>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.section {
		padding: 85px 24px;
	}

	.section-container {
		max-width: 1240px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.section-badge {
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.2em;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--gold-primary);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		display: inline-block;
		margin-bottom: 12px;
	}

	.section-title {
		font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		margin-bottom: 16px;
		line-height: 1.2;
	}

	.adv-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
		gap: 60px;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.adv-desc {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		margin-bottom: 36px;
	}

	.features-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 24px;
	}

	.feature-item {
		display: flex;
		gap: 16px;
	}

	.check-box {
		width: 32px;
		height: 32px;
		border-radius: 8px;
		background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15);
		border: 1px solid var(--gold-primary);
		color: var(--gold-primary);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.feature-item h4 {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		margin-bottom: 4px;
	}

	.feature-item p {
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.vault-card {
		padding: 36px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	.vault-header {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		margin-bottom: 20px;
	}

	.vault-tag {
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.15em;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.vault-live {
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		color: #10b981;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.vault-amount {
		font-size: 2.6rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		line-height: 1.1;
		margin-bottom: 6px;
	}

	.vault-growth {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: #10b981;
		font-weight: 600;
		margin-bottom: 30px;
	}

	.vault-bars {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-end;
		gap: 12px;
		height: 110px;
		padding-bottom: 12px;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
		margin-bottom: 24px;
	}

	.bar {
		flex: 1;
		border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0;
		background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2), var(--gold-primary));
	}

	.bar-1 { height: 40%; }
	.bar-2 { height: 55%; }
	.bar-3 { height: 50%; }
	.bar-4 { height: 75%; }
	.bar-5 { height: 65%; }
	.bar-6 { height: 85%; }
	.bar-7 { height: 100%; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.5); }

	.vault-footer {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
	}

	.v-item small {
		display: block;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin-bottom: 2px;
	}

	.v-item strong {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: var(--text-primary);
	}

	.text-right {
		text-align: right;
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.adv-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}

	/* ============ MÓVIL ============ */
	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.section {
			padding: 56px 18px;
		}

		.adv-grid {
			gap: 38px;
		}

		.adv-desc {
			margin-bottom: 28px;
			line-height: 1.7;
		}

		.features-list {
			gap: 20px;
		}

		.feature-item {
			gap: 12px;
		}

		.check-box {
			width: 28px;
			height: 28px;
		}

		.feature-item h4 {
			font-size: 1rem;
		}

		/* La tarjeta de la bóveda tiene padding y cifras grandes */
		.vault-card {
			padding: 24px 20px;
		}

		.vault-amount {
			font-size: 2rem;
		}

		.vault-bars {
			height: 86px;
			gap: 8px;
		}

		/* El pie pasa a apilarse para no comprimir los textos */
		.vault-footer {
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 14px;
		}

		.text-right {
			text-align: left;
		}
	}
</style>
